WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.230
- Welcome back everybody.

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:03.180
Before we go, I have
one more inspiring story

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:04.530
from social media to share.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.576
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.576 --> 00:00:08.700
(rock music)

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.980
June is National Cancer Survivor Month.

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.730
Nearly 17 million people in
the US are cancer survivors.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.490
That includes anyone currently
battling the disease as well.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.060
So, if you're fighting cancer
right now, you are a survivor.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.160
I want to introduce you
to one cancer survivor

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:25.440
with an inspiring message for everybody.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.700
Say hello to Crisann

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.831
who watches on NBC 4 Los Angeles.

00:00:28.831 --> 00:00:31.110
So Crisann, you are welcome

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.856
to the show first of all, hello.

00:00:32.856 --> 00:00:33.988
(audience clapping)

00:00:33.988 --> 00:00:35.264
- Thank you.

00:00:35.264 --> 00:00:37.590
- You are battling cancer as we speak.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:38.426
Is this right?

00:00:38.426 --> 00:00:42.600
- Yeah, I was diagnosed
about two years ago

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.930
and I've been fighting
it every day since then.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:49.200
I'm a single mom, so it's
a little bit tough for me

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:53.460
because I have stage four
metastatic breast cancer.

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:56.580
But I go in every three
weeks and I get my treatment

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.190
and I think as every survivor knows,

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.930
you just keep moving forward.

00:01:00.930 --> 00:01:02.984
You don't stop, you keep moving.

00:01:02.984 --> 00:01:04.920
And I think I can speak for all of us

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:06.660
when I say that we're so grateful

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:09.030
to be having continued treatment

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:12.210
and for all of the doctors and the nurses

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.090
and the hospital staff that
help us get through this.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:19.470
You know, cancer changes
you in every possible way.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.720
It makes you know beyond
a shadow of a doubt

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.580
what's really important in life.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:27.000
And for me, that's the
amazing network of support

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.000
that I have that helps me get through it

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.700
and makes me grateful for
every day that I'm given.

00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:33.533
- Wow.

00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:34.366
Well, you discovered something

00:01:34.366 --> 00:01:35.310
on this journey that's helped.

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:36.810
What is that?

00:01:36.810 --> 00:01:40.620
- I think really just to enjoy
your life every day, right?

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.450
Right now, right this very minute.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:46.225
For me, I enjoy "Ted Lasso."

00:01:46.225 --> 00:01:47.820
- Love "Ted Lasso."
- The show makes me so happy.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.830
It fills me with such joy.

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:53.250
I mean, it's really
ultimately about kindness.

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.310
And cancer teaches you about kindness.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.650
I even heard from some
of the cast members.

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:02.520
They sent me get well
and encouragement videos,

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.580
and were just completely amazing.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.071
But what I think I wanna say

00:02:07.071 --> 00:02:12.071
and remind everybody is that
cancer touches all of us.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:12.983
You know?

00:02:12.983 --> 00:02:16.680
So, lend your support
and celebrate the people

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.140
who are fighting this battle right now.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:21.450
Whether it's somebody you know with cancer

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.730
or a healthcare professional

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.800
that is helping somebody battle cancer.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:27.930
Give them your celebration and support.

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:30.450
I mean, we're gonna win this fight,

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.670
but we would love your support too.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:33.630
- Absolutely.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:34.740
Thank you so much, Crisann,

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:36.570
for sharing your story with us.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:37.740
I'm a single mama as well.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:39.600
I can't imagine all that's
on your plate right now.

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.980
So, God bless you.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:41.813
You're in my prayers.

00:02:41.813 --> 00:02:42.646
You're in my thoughts.

00:02:42.646 --> 00:02:43.479
You're in all of our thoughts.

00:02:43.479 --> 00:02:44.646
I'm liking your post right now, all right.

00:02:44.646 --> 00:02:47.013
(audience clapping)

00:02:47.013 --> 00:02:48.660
- [Crisann] Thank you.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:49.770
- And that's not all Crisann.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:52.020
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.490
the go-to pen of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:56.250
want to celebrate unstoppable
people just like you, ma'am.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.510
So they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:02:58.343
How's that sound?

00:02:58.343 --> 00:02:59.828
(audience clapping)

00:02:59.828 --> 00:03:01.620
- Oh, thank you.

00:03:01.620 --> 00:03:02.893
That's so great.

00:03:02.893 --> 00:03:03.726
I really appreciate that.

00:03:03.726 --> 00:03:04.559
- Absolutely.

00:03:04.559 --> 00:03:06.270
And I have to say I love
your rock and roll hair.

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:07.470
I just couldn't let you leave

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:08.880
without me talking about your pink hair.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.649
It's so cute.
- Thank you.

00:03:10.649 --> 00:03:11.550
- So, thank you so much Crisann.

00:03:11.550 --> 00:03:13.560
and thank you to all of
our guests this hour:

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.680
Eva Longoria, Annie
Gonzalez, Jesse Garcia,

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:17.640
and Colton Dixon.

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:18.473
Y'all have a great day

00:03:18.473 --> 00:03:20.310
and if it's not, try and change it.

